@startuml
title Restaurant Rush Stage 2 - Critic vs New Customer (Turn 16 Decision)


hide footbox
autonumber


actor Manager
boundary "RestaurantCLI" as CLI
control "GameController" as GC
entity "GameState" as GS
control "TurnProcessor" as TP
participant "Waiter" as W
participant "Chef" as Chef
participant "Cashier" as Cashier
participant "CustomerChoiceGenerator" as CG
entity "CriticCustomer #5" as CR
entity "Customer #6" as C6
entity "Table 1" as T1
entity "Table 2" as T2
entity "Critic Pasta Order" as O
participant "MenuItem (current item)" as MI


note over Manager,GS
Stage 2 scenario (relevant calls shown):
Critic C5 arrives Turn 13; Regular C6 arrives Turn 16.
Critic selects Pasta ($18.00; 2 preparation units).
Critic loses 12 per turn only when WAITING or SEATED.


Assumptions: T1 free Turn 13; T2 free Turn 16;
all chosen actions valid; order price remains 1800 cents;
no earlier customer is eligible to pay on Turn 18.
end note


note right of C6
Option A: C6 remains WAITING.
Option B: C6 remains SEATED.


Both statuses lose 8 satisfaction
per turn for a regular customer.


Turn 16: 92
Turn 17: 84
Turn 18: 76
end note


== Turn 13 - Critic arrives ==


CLI -> GC : startTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : isGameOver()
GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
GC -> GC : processArrivals()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()


loop each arrival index i
    opt ARRIVAL_TURNS[i] == 13
        GC -> GS : nextCustomerId()
        create CR
        GC -> CR : new CriticCustomer(5)
        GC -> GS : addCustomer(CR)
    end
end


deactivate GC
deactivate GC


Manager -> CLI : Seat Critic C5 at Table 1
CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(SeatChoice)
activate GC
GC -> GS : findWaitingCustomer(5)
GC -> GS : findTable(1)
GC -> T1 : isAvailable()
T1 --> GC : true
GC -> W : seat(CR, T1)
W -> CR : seatAt(T1)
CR -> T1 : isAvailable()
T1 --> CR : true
CR -> T1 : occupy(CR)
GC -> GS : removeWaitingCustomer(CR)
note right of GC : Waiter action used for Turn 13
GC --> CLI : null (success)
deactivate GC


Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
note over CLI,Chef
CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
end note


CLI -> GC : endTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(13)
activate TP


TP -> TP : processEating(13)
note right of TP : Critic cannot finish eating this turn


TP -> TP : processPayments(13)
note right of TP : Critic cannot pay; other customers omitted


TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
loop for each customer
    opt customer == Critic C5
        TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
        note right of CR : SEATED; -12 -> 88
    end
end


TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


deactivate TP
note right of GC : turnActive = false
deactivate GC


note right of CR : End Turn 13: SEATED, satisfaction 88


== Turn 14 - Order and first preparation ==


CLI -> GC : startTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : isGameOver()
GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
GC -> GC : processArrivals()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
deactivate GC
deactivate GC


Manager -> CLI : Take Critic order
CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(TakeOrderChoice)
activate GC
GC -> GS : findTable(1)
GC -> T1 : getOccupant()
T1 --> GC : CR
GC -> CR : getStatus()
GC -> CR : getOrder()
GC -> CG : chooseItem(menu, CR)
CG -> CR : chooseMenuItem(items)


loop each item until Pasta is found
    CR -> MI : getName()
    MI --> CR : name


    alt name equalsIgnoreCase("Pasta")
        note right of CR : Return this Pasta item
    else other menu item
        note right of CR : Continue searching
    end
end


CR --> CG : Pasta
CG --> GC : Pasta
GC -> GS : nextOrderId()
GC -> CR : getCustomerId()


create O
GC -> O : new Order(orderId, 5, Pasta)


note right of O
PLACED; remainingUnits = 2;
finalPriceCents = 1800; readyTurn = -1.
end note


GC -> W : takeOrder(CR, O)
W -> CR : assignOrder(O)
CR -> CR : calculateBillCents()
CR -> O : setFinalPriceCents(1800)
GC -> GS : addOrder(O)
note right of GC : Waiter action used for Turn 14
GC --> CLI : null (success)
deactivate GC


Manager -> CLI : Chef selects Pasta order
CLI -> GC : executeChefChoice(orderId)
activate GC
GC -> GS : findOrder(orderId)
GC -> O : getStatus()
GC -> O : getRemainingUnits()
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
GC -> Chef : prepare(O, 14)
Chef -> O : getStatus()
Chef -> O : advance(14)


note right of O
remainingUnits: 2 -> 1
status: PREPARING
end note


GC --> CLI : null (success)
deactivate GC


CLI -> GC : endTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(14)
activate TP


TP -> TP : processEating(14)
note right of TP : Critic cannot finish eating this turn


TP -> TP : processPayments(14)
note right of TP : Critic cannot pay; other customers omitted


TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
loop for each customer
    opt customer == Critic C5
        TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
        note right of CR : SEATED; -12 -> 76
    end
end


TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


deactivate TP
note right of GC : turnActive = false
deactivate GC


note right of CR : End Turn 14: SEATED, satisfaction 76


== Turn 15 - Pasta becomes READY ==


CLI -> GC : startTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : isGameOver()
GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
GC -> GC : processArrivals()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
deactivate GC
deactivate GC


Manager -> CLI : Waiter chooses WAIT
CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(WaitChoice)
GC --> CLI : null (success)


Manager -> CLI : Chef selects Pasta order (second unit)
CLI -> GC : executeChefChoice(orderId)
activate GC
GC -> GS : findOrder(orderId)
GC -> O : getStatus()
GC -> O : getRemainingUnits()
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
GC -> Chef : prepare(O, 15)
Chef -> O : getStatus()
Chef -> O : advance(15)


note right of O
remainingUnits: 1 -> 0
status: READY
readyTurn = 15
canBeServedOn(15) = false;
canBeServedOn(16) = true.
end note


GC --> CLI : null (success)
deactivate GC


CLI -> GC : endTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(15)
activate TP


TP -> TP : processEating(15)
note right of TP : Critic cannot finish eating this turn


TP -> TP : processPayments(15)
note right of TP : Critic cannot pay; other customers omitted


TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
loop for each customer
    opt customer == Critic C5
        TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
        note right of CR : SEATED; -12 -> 64
    end
end


TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


deactivate TP
note right of GC : turnActive = false
deactivate GC


note right of CR : End Turn 15: SEATED, satisfaction 64


== Turn 16 - Manager chooses one Waiter task ==


CLI -> GC : startTurn()
activate GC
GC -> GS : isGameOver()
GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
GC -> GC : processArrivals()
activate GC
GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()


loop each arrival index i
    opt ARRIVAL_TURNS[i] == 16
        GC -> GS : nextCustomerId()
        create C6
        GC -> C6 : new Customer(6)
        GC -> GS : addCustomer(C6)
    end
end


deactivate GC
deactivate GC


note over Manager,GC
ONE Waiter action on Turn 16:
A: serve Critic C5, or
B: seat the newly arrived C6.
The Chef action is separate.
end note


alt Option A - Serve Critic C5


    Manager -> CLI : Serve Critic C5
    CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(ServeChoice)
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : findOrder(orderId)
    GC -> O : getStatus()
    O --> GC : READY
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> O : canBeServedOn(16)
    O --> GC : true
    GC -> O : getCustomerId()
    GC -> GS : findCustomer(5)
    GC -> CR : getStatus()
    GC -> CR : getOrder()
    GC -> W : serve(O, CR, 16)
    W -> O : markServed()
    W -> CR : onServed(16)
    GC -> GS : recordServedCustomer()
    GC --> CLI : null (success)
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
    note over CLI,Chef
    CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
    CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
    end note


    CLI -> GC : endTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(16)
    activate TP


    TP -> TP : processEating(16)
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : getStatus()
            TP -> CR : getServedTurn()
            note right of CR : Served this turn; still EATING
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : processPayments(16)
    note right of TP : Critic cannot pay; other customers omitted


    TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of CR : EATING; no deduction -> 64
        end
        opt customer == Regular C6
            TP -> C6 : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of C6 : WAITING; -8 -> 92
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
    note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


    deactivate TP
    note right of GC : turnActive = false
    deactivate GC


    note right of CR : End Turn 16: EATING, satisfaction 64


    == Turn 17A - Critic finishes eating ==


    CLI -> GC : startTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : isGameOver()
    GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
    GC -> GC : processArrivals()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    deactivate GC
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Waiter chooses WAIT
    CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(WaitChoice)
    GC --> CLI : null (success)


    Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
    note over CLI,Chef
    CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
    CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
    end note


    CLI -> GC : endTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(17)
    activate TP


    TP -> TP : processEating(17)
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : getStatus()
            TP -> CR : getServedTurn()
            opt 17 > servedTurn
                TP -> CR : finishEating(17)
            end
            note right of CR : READY_TO_PAY; readyToPayTurn = 17
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : processPayments(17)
    loop customers in arrival order
        opt current customer == Critic C5 (if reached)
            TP -> CR : canPayOn(17)
            CR --> TP : false
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of CR : READY_TO_PAY; no deduction -> 64
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
    note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


    deactivate TP
    note right of GC : turnActive = false
    deactivate GC


    note right of CR : End Turn 17: READY_TO_PAY, satisfaction 64


    == Turn 18A - Critic pays ==


    CLI -> GC : startTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : isGameOver()
    GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
    GC -> GC : processArrivals()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    deactivate GC
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Waiter chooses WAIT
    CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(WaitChoice)
    GC --> CLI : null (success)


    Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
    note over CLI,Chef
    CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
    CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
    end note


    CLI -> GC : endTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(18)
    activate TP


    TP -> TP : processEating(18)
    note right of TP 
Critic already finished eating on Turn 17.
Status is READY_TO_PAY.
No finishEating() call on Turn 18.
end note


    TP -> TP : processPayments(18)


    note over TP,CR
    Earlier customers cannot pay on Turn 18
    (explicit scenario assumption).
    Process at most one eligible payment.
    end note


    loop customers in arrival order
        opt current customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : canPayOn(18)
            CR --> TP : true
            TP -> Cashier : processPayment(CR, 18)
            activate Cashier
            Cashier -> CR : canPayOn(18)
            CR --> Cashier : true
            Cashier -> O : getFinalPriceCents()
            O --> Cashier : 1800
            Cashier -> O : markPaid()
            Cashier -> CR : onPaid()
            Cashier -> T1 : free()
            Cashier --> TP : 1800
            deactivate Cashier
            TP -> GS : recordPayment(CR, 1800)
            note right of TP
            The first eligible customer is paid.
            processPayments() returns immediately.
            No other customer can pay this turn.
            end note
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of CR : PAID; no deduction -> 64
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
    note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


    deactivate TP
    note right of GC : turnActive = false
    deactivate GC


    note right of CR : End Turn 18: PAID, satisfaction 64


    note over CR,GS
    OPTION A: Critic pays $18.00 on Turn 18.
    Paid count +1; revenue +1800 cents;
    paid satisfaction recorded = 64.
    This follows the stated payment-slot assumption.
    end note


else Option B - Seat new Customer C6


    Manager -> CLI : Seat C6 at Table 2
    CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(SeatChoice)
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : findWaitingCustomer(6)
    GC -> GS : findTable(2)
    GC -> T2 : isAvailable()
    T2 --> GC : true
    GC -> W : seat(C6, T2)
    W -> C6 : seatAt(T2)
    C6 -> T2 : isAvailable()
    T2 --> C6 : true
    C6 -> T2 : occupy(C6)
    GC -> GS : removeWaitingCustomer(C6)
    GC --> CLI : null (success)
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
    note over CLI,Chef
    CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
    CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
    end note


    CLI -> GC : endTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(16)
    activate TP


    TP -> TP : processEating(16)
    note right of TP : Critic cannot finish eating this turn


    TP -> TP : processPayments(16)
    note right of TP : Critic cannot pay; other customers omitted


    TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of CR : SEATED; -12 -> 52
        end
        opt customer == Regular C6
            TP -> C6 : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of C6 : SEATED; -8 -> 92
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
    note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


    deactivate TP
    note right of GC : turnActive = false
    deactivate GC


    note right of CR : End Turn 16: SEATED, satisfaction 52


    == Turn 17B - Critic served one turn late ==


    CLI -> GC : startTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : isGameOver()
    GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
    GC -> GC : processArrivals()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    deactivate GC
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Serve Critic C5
    CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(ServeChoice)
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : findOrder(orderId)
    GC -> O : getStatus()
    O --> GC : READY
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> O : canBeServedOn(17)
    O --> GC : true
    GC -> O : getCustomerId()
    GC -> GS : findCustomer(5)
    GC -> CR : getStatus()
    GC -> CR : getOrder()
    GC -> W : serve(O, CR, 17)
    W -> O : markServed()
    W -> CR : onServed(17)
    GC -> GS : recordServedCustomer()
    GC --> CLI : null (success)
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
    note over CLI,Chef
    CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
    CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
    end note


    CLI -> GC : endTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(17)
    activate TP


    TP -> TP : processEating(17)
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : getStatus()
            TP -> CR : getServedTurn()
            note right of CR : Served this turn; still EATING
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : processPayments(17)
    note right of TP : Critic cannot pay; other customers omitted


    TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of CR : EATING; no deduction -> 52
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
    note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


    deactivate TP
    note right of GC : turnActive = false
    deactivate GC


    note right of CR : End Turn 17: EATING, satisfaction 52


    == Turn 18B - Critic finishes eating too late ==


    CLI -> GC : startTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : isGameOver()
    GC -> GS : advanceTurn()
    GC -> GC : processArrivals()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    deactivate GC
    deactivate GC


    Manager -> CLI : Waiter chooses WAIT
    CLI -> GC : executeWaiterChoice(WaitChoice)
    GC --> CLI : null (success)


    Manager -> CLI : Chef chooses 0 (skip)
    note over CLI,Chef
    CLI getChefOrderChoice() returns -1.
    CLI does not call executeChefChoice().
    end note


    CLI -> GC : endTurn()
    activate GC
    GC -> GS : getCurrentTurn()
    GC -> TP : runEndOfTurn(18)
    activate TP


    TP -> TP : processEating(18)
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : getStatus()
            TP -> CR : getServedTurn()
            opt 18 > servedTurn
                TP -> CR : finishEating(18)
            end
            note right of CR : READY_TO_PAY; readyToPayTurn = 18
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : processPayments(18)
    loop customers in arrival order
        opt current customer == Critic C5 (if reached)
            TP -> CR : canPayOn(18)
            CR --> TP : false
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : updateSatisfaction()
    loop for each customer
        opt customer == Critic C5
            TP -> CR : decreaseSatisfaction()
            note right of CR : READY_TO_PAY; no deduction -> 52
        end
    end


    TP -> TP : handleAbandonment()
    note right of TP : Loops over all; Critic does not abandon


    deactivate TP
    note right of GC : turnActive = false
    deactivate GC


    note right of CR : End Turn 18: READY_TO_PAY, satisfaction 52


    note over CR,GS
    OPTION B: Critic finishes eating on Turn 18.
    readyToPayTurn = 18; earliest payment turn = 19.
    The game ends after Turn 18, so Critic
    contributes $0 and 0 paid customers.
    C6 cannot complete the payment cycle either.
    Compared with A: one Critic payment foregone.
    end note


end


== Final game result ==


CLI -> GC : isGameOver()
GC -> GS : isGameOver()
GS --> GC : true
GC --> CLI : true
CLI -> GC : checkResult()
GC -> GS : checkResult()
GS --> GC : GameResult
GC --> CLI : GameResult
CLI -> CLI : displayResult(GameResult)


note over Manager,GS
This decision changes whether Critic C5 can pay
within the 18-turn deadline. The overall VICTORY
or DEFEAT still depends on paid count, revenue,
and average satisfaction of paid customers.
end note


@enduml